<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Peladang 1996 net up 19.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Peladang 1996 net up 19.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)   44.43	vs	  41.66</p>
<p>    Net profit		57.28	vs	  48.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		 492.88	vs	 450.44</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 130.33	vs	 108.41</p>
<p>    Minorities  (less)    32.48	vs (less) 27.26</p>
<p>    Dividends   (pct)	8.00	vs	   8.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Peladang Kimia Bhd is involved in the manufacture and sale of fertilisers and chemical products, property development and the hotel industry.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
